# Price grid, Standard rows (TC-278 – TC-295): tap the fps and Resolution chips at 08:00, then read the CTA price and
# 「Selected Length」 at 00:30, 01:30, the 08:00 cap and 00:30 again. Charges nothing: Enhance is never tapped.
# Starts: AI Video Enhance panel with ve-1230-1080p30 (Add Media sorted Duration / Descending, second 12:30 tile; the
# first is ve-1230-1080p60), panel scrolled down (trim strip visible), selection 00:00–08:00, Mode Standard, the style
# already set (tap chip_style_sharp before the Sharp rows), no cap bubble showing.
# Ends: the same state (selection back to 00:00–08:00), with the row's chips selected.
# Args: $1 = case ID, $2 = fps chip id (chip_fps_30|60|120), $3 = resolution chip id (chip_resolution_720p|1080p|4k).
# Coordinates measured 2026-11-18 on the SM-A5360 (1080 × 2400), 16.9.0 (2611091): the strip maps ~0.587 s per pixel;
# the right handle at the cap is grabbed at x 980, y 1158; finger 212 leaves 「00:30」 (30.x s), 315 「01:30」 (90.x s),
# 1060 pushes it to the cap. Finger 211 leaves 「00:29」 (29.x s): no pixel, or sub-pixel to 0.01 px, gives exactly 30.000 s.
# The panel scroll (540 1750 → 1250) brings the Resolution chips above the CTA bar; never tap a chip under the CTA.
# The cap bubble 「Up to 8 minutes in Standard mode」 swallows the next touch and hides the panel from `els`: wait 3 s.
# Recalibrated 2026-11-26 on 2611251 (R4-d2): the 12:30 source draws the strip 66 px lower (O-6), handles at y 1224;
# 「Selected Length」 now rounds up (P0075 fix), so finger 210 = 「00:30」 (bills 30), 313 = 「01:30」 (bills 90);
# 212 / 315 now read 「00:31」 / 「01:31」. Never drag from x 980 unless the handle is at the cap: beside a short
# selection that drag scrolls the strip and moves the whole selection.
case $1
fingerdrag 540 1750 540 1250 10
id $2
id $3
wait 1
els chip_
els tv_charge
shot $1-chips
fingerdrag 540 1250 540 1750 10
wait 1
fingerdrag 980 1224 210 1224 20
els tv_
shot $1-30s
fingerdrag 210 1224 313 1224 20
els tv_
shot $1-90s
fingerdrag 313 1224 1060 1224 15
shot $1-cap
wait 3
els tv_
fingerdrag 980 1224 210 1224 20
els tv_
els chip_
shot $1-back30
fingerdrag 210 1224 1060 1224 15
wait 3
